{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Болбогурду ошол эл,", "text": "Болбогурду ошол эл,", "en": "That people took the good-for-nothing,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The line is clear but its sentence continues into the next baseline.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Караан кылып алыптыр,", "text": "Караан кылып алыптыр,", "en": "And made him their champion.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Clear; караан has the contextual sense of a person relied upon.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Ураактагы Ходынчтын,", "text": "Ураактагы Ходынчтын,", "en": "Of distant Khodynch,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The place or people name is difficult and provisionally read Ходынчтын.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Каканчынын мыктысы каны экен,", "text": "Каканчынын мыктысы каны экен,", "en": "The finest of the Khakanians was its khan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The long baseline is faint; Каканчынын and the syntax are provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Кырк хан эли кытайдан,", "text": "Кырк хан эли кытайдан,", "en": "Among the Chinese people of forty khans,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Clear apart from whether хан qualifies эл collectively.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Миң көздөрүн молу экен,", "text": "Миң көздөрүн молу экен,", "en": "There were a thousand watchful eyes,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The manuscript appears to read Миң көздөрүн молу экен; grammar and meaning are uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Эл багар көкжал бару экен,", "text": "Эл багар көкжал бару экен,", "en": "There was a gray-maned hero to rule the people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final words are provisionally read бару экен.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Ходынчтын баарына,", "text": "Ходынчтын баарына,", "en": "To all of Khodynch,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The proper name is provisionally read Ходынч.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Кулак кагаз угузуп,", "text": "Кулак кагаз угузуп,", "en": "Sending word by a written notice,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first compound is read Кулак кагаз; its precise sense is uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Эбей, Шыгай улугу,", "text": "Эбей, Шыгай улугу,", "en": "The nobles Ebei and Shygai,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The two names and улугу are reasonably visible but may be variant names.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Каканга казак баштаттыр,", "text": "Каканга казак баштаттыр,", "en": "He set the Kazakhs marching against the Khakan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The verb and object are difficult; provisionally read Каканга казак баштаттыр.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Ар жандуусу жыйылып,", "text": "Ар жандуусу жыйылып,", "en": "Every living soul gathered,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening word is faint but appears to be Ар.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Кылычын керген кытайы,", "text": "Кылычын керген кытайы,", "en": "The Chinese who had drawn their swords,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The manuscript form is read Кылычын керген; possibly a different verb.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Кырк хан эли кытайдын,", "text": "Кырк хан эли кытайдын,", "en": "The Chinese people of forty khans,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Clear; the genitive leads into the following baseline.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Бээжинде жыйылып,", "text": "Бээжинде жыйылып,", "en": "Gathered in Beijing,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The place name and verb are clear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Бул нур төгүлгөн Бээжинге,", "text": "Бул нур төгүлгөн Бээжинге,", "en": "In this Beijing upon which radiance poured,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle word is read төгүлгөн; slightly faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Бу түгөнгүс жерине,", "text": "Бу түгөнгүс жерине,", "en": "In this inexhaustible land,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The adjective is provisionally read түгөнгүс.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Ошондогу турган Кары хан,", "text": "Ошондогу турган Кары хан,", "en": "There then stood the Old Khan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The name or epithet Кары хан is clear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Кары хандын көзүндө,", "text": "Кары хандын көзүндө,", "en": "Before the eyes of the Old Khan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The case ending on хандын is faint but the reading fits the visible text.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Хан болгону он хандын,", "text": "Хан болгону он хандын,", "en": "The one who became khan over ten khans,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The syntax may instead continue a count into the next line.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Эки миң жылга толгондо,", "text": "Эки миң жылга толгондо,", "en": "When two thousand years had been fulfilled,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The numeral appears to read Эки миң, though this extraordinary age may be formulaic.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Узак жашап Кары хан,", "text": "Узак жашап Кары хан,", "en": "The Old Khan lived long,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Clear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Эл арасы болгондо,", "text": "Эл арасы болгондо,", "en": "When he was among the people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Clear words; contextual subject supplied in English.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Алтайда туулуп зор болуп,", "text": "Алтайда туулуп зор болуп,", "en": "Born in Altai and grown mighty,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The place name is read Алтайда; the first letter is faint.", "bbox": null}
