{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf036:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 36, "folio": 419, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Кырк уруу кытай Каканга,", "text": "Кырк уруу кытай Каканга,", "en": "The forty tribes of China, to the Khakan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Clear overall; the sentence continues into the next baseline.", "bbox": null}
